msgctxt "web"
msgid "Send a game"
msgstr "Een game sturen"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:53
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Choose a game's folder: it goes to PC5's INSTALL folder, then PC5 asks to "
"install it."
msgstr ""
"Kies de map van een game: die gaat naar de INSTALL-map van PC5, en daarna "
"vraagt PC5 of je hem wilt installeren."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:55
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose a folder"
msgstr "Kies een map"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:57
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"A phone that can't choose a folder: type the game's folder name, then "
"choose its files."
msgstr ""
"Een telefoon die geen map kan kiezen: typ de mapnaam van de game en kies "
"dan de bestanden."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:60
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose files"
msgstr "Kies bestanden"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:66
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Games"
msgstr "Games"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:66
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Vernieuwen"

